野狗的滑稽動作逗樂了。他通常很放鬆。他有些懶。同時，野狗個性健談、調皮、頑皮。他非常喜歡北極熊，並且不斷試圖吸引他的注意。他經常被北極熊戲弄。請畫一幅野狗守護北極熊的場景。北極熊就像黑手黨老大。野狗就像他忠誠的下屬。謝謝你！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1wFWfUyRKSUT9Zn3KUrWZ8U9E5OnAtgww?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@koma_ver0/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3de06415/uploads/origins/7a60a308-a00b-4ef3-870c-283c166b52d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3daae41ba3f96d7e6a5480815fd7f74d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3de06415/uploads/origins/7a60a308-a00b-4ef3-870c-283c166b52d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3daae41ba3f96d7e6a5480815fd7f74d, https://si.imgix.net/3de06415/uploads/origins/7a60a308-a00b-4ef3-870c-283c166b52d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a16a13d3b31cfdc8b2c9e4a1e79f21ee 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3de06415/uploads/origins/7a60a308-a00b-4ef3-870c-283c166b52d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd2daa195c78e59df66723ec14e9c77b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "你好！你的藝術真可愛！你能畫一隻正在互動的黑豹和紅狐嗎？它們基於參考資料夾中的人類角色，但我希望看到它們按照您的風格繪製為動物。黑豹嚴肅但又充滿愛心。他照顧紅狐並愛他。他很容易因紅狐的滑稽動作而感到尷尬和慌亂。他保護紅狐。紅狐驕傲自大，喜歡捉弄黑豹。他為自己感到驕傲，非常自信，但也很古怪。請畫一幅狐狸正在探索和尋找寶藏的場景。黑豹保護性地跟著他。謝謝你！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1i0_sJCYDXfEDYYOS7EYHx_5v0_TVCU7M?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@koma_ver0/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/959628d7/uploads/origins/35d46581-3647-44fa-bcb9-57c9d27aad3f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e11416e3ab990759b2410669d320ff5c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/959628d7/uploads/origins/35d46581-3647-44fa-bcb9-57c9d27aad3f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e11416e3ab990759b2410669d320ff5c, https://si.imgix.net/959628d7/uploads/origins/35d46581-3647-44fa-bcb9-57c9d27aad3f?bg=%23fff&auto=format